text-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Dump</b> is a monster that is exclusive to <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dross\" title=\"Dross\"><img alt=\"Dross\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dross icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dross_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a2/Stage_Dross_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172300\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dross\" title=\"Dross\">Dross</a>. \n</p><p>Dump is consistently in a puddle of <a href=\"/wiki/Creep#Brown_Creep\" title=\"Creep\">Brown Creep</a> and leaves a trail while chasing Isaac. When it takes enough damage, its head comes off and flies around the room while its body spews out brown shots like a geyser until it empties and disappears into the ground.\n</p><p>This enemy has 3 different facial expressions, all of which are purely cosmetic and don't affect how its head looks after it detaches.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dump_Head\">Dump Head</span></h2><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wiki